  "name": "Example: \n                    Cases When the Perfect Square is Isolated",
  "problem": "Solve $-2(3k-12)^2 = 0.$",
  "worked_solution": "We can solve this equation using the square root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2(3k-12)^{2} & =0 \\\\ (3k-12)^{2} & =0 \\\\ \\sqrt{(3k-12)^{2}} & =\\sqrt{0} \\\\ |3k-12| & =0 \\\\ 3k-12 & =0 \\\\ 3k & =12 \\\\ k & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$",
